"After you have started &kaddressbook; (either using the &kmenu; or by typing "
"<command>kaddressbook</command> at the command prompt or by using the "
"<guilabel>Contacts</guilabel> tab in &kontact;) the &kaddressbook; main "
"window will be displayed:"
