#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure Resources"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kaddressbook; can use multiple resources for loading and storing its "
"contacts. After starting &kaddressbook; for the first time you will have a "
"default resource installed that saves all contacts in a vCard file under "
"<filename>$<envar>HOME</envar>/.kde/share/apps/kabc/std.vcf</filename>; you "
"can add more resources by using the <guilabel>Resource Configuration</"
"guilabel> dialog, which is available in the &kcontrolcenter; under "
"<guilabel>&kde; Components</guilabel>-> <guilabel>&kde; Resources</guilabel>:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Resource Configuration Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The Resource Configuration Dialog.</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The Resource Configuration Dialog.</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Load the configuration module you want to add your resource(s) to. By "
"selecting it from the combo box at the top of the <guilabel>Resources</"
"guilabel> section. The module for configuring &kaddressbook;'s resources is "
"<guilabel>Contacts</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Launch the <guilabel>Resource Configuration</guilabel> dialog by pushing the "
"<guibutton>Add...</guibutton> button. Choose the resource you want to add to "
"your <guilabel>Contacts</guilabel> module and click <guilabel>OK</guilabel> "
"to confirm your choice."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Repertòri"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Each contact will be stored in its own file;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "File"
msgstr "Fichièr"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "All contacts will be stored in one file;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "GroupDAV Server (e.g. Open Groupware)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:152 index.docbook:157 index.docbook:183 index.docbook:198
