#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Command Line Options"
msgstr "Opcions de linha de comanda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kaddressbook; supports some command-line arguments, which can be used to "
"influence its starting behavior:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1392
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kaddressbook</command> <option>-a, --addr &lt;email&gt;</option>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1393
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows the contact editor with the given email address."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1396
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kaddressbook</command> <option>--uid &lt;uid&gt;</option>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1397
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows the contact editor with the given uid."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1400
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kaddressbook</command> <option>--editor-only</option>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1401
#, no-c-format
msgid "Launches in editor only mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:1404
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>kaddressbook</command> <option>--new-contact</option>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1405
#, no-c-format
msgid "Launches an editor for a new contact."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kaddressbook; also supports all other command-line options common to &kde; "
"and &Qt; programs; you can get a list of these options with "
"<userinput><option>--help</option></userinput>, <userinput><option>--help-"
"kde</option></userinput>, and <userinput><option>--help-qt</option></"
"userinput>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1417
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options Without a User Interface Representation"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apart from the options presented in the configuration dialog, some options "
"can only be set directly in the configuration file ($KDEHOME/share/config/"
"kaddressbookrc) or through KIOSK."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1427
#, no-c-format
msgid "ContactListAboveExtensions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, extensions (e.g. the distribution list editor) are shown below "
"the contact list, not in an separate column. By default, this option is "
"disabled. To enable this option, add a line reading (under [MainWindow] "
"section):"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: programlisting
#: index.docbook:1435
#, no-c-format
msgid "ContactListAboveExtensions=true"
msgstr ""

